    "created_at": "2017-06-02T14:24:44Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-06-02T14:24:44Z",
    "body": "Depending on when hixie was speccing this, Gecko may well have changed.  A long enough time ago, Gecko did the resource loading for `<object>` from the layout box, not the element...\r\n\r\nI'll defer to @qdot on what exactly Gecko does; I don't remember it offhand...",
